  "_about": "Hugging Face Hub searches for Hebrew models. mode 'tag' = Hebrew language tag + one task (pipeline_tag) + one sort: the firehose, mostly multilingual models. mode 'name' = model ids containing 'heb' (also matches 'hebrew') + one task: the specialist lane. scripts/snapshot.py runs them; web_url is the same search in the browser. Add a permutation by adding an entry; ids are <task-short>-<sort> or <task-short>-name.",
